Y4 dialogue typewriter -- the wiring points.

The feature itself is in the three Y4 owned headers
(battle_presentation_script.h, battle_presentation_text_layout.h,
battle_presentation_content.h).  These five points are the only
wiring it needs; they are in game/src/battle_runtime_scene.cpp (Y1)
and game/include/konoha/battle_scene_controller.h (unowned).

Apply from the root of the remake checkout with:
    git apply notes/s49-fidelity/Y4-dialogue-typewriter-wiring.patch

